 "We are an online fellowship built on the 3-2-1 ideology, connecting godly believers in Taiwan, Malaysia, China, Indonesia, Singapore, New Zealand, Australia, Korea, Japan and many other countries. Every day we meet online to learn the truth of Scripture and practise living out the life of Christ.": "Sisi ni jumuiya ya mtandaoni iliyojengwa juu ya itikadi ya 3-2-1, inayowaunganisha waumini wacha Mungu wa Taiwan, Malaysia, China, Indonesia, Singapore, New Zealand, Australia, Korea, Japan na nchi nyingine nyingi. Kila siku tunakutana mtandaoni kujifunza kweli ya Maandiko na kufanya mazoezi ya kuishi maisha ya Kristo.",
 "We see our problem — the old self-centred life, pride, wanting to take God’s place — and we see God’s grace: Jesus’ death deals with our sin, and His resurrection gives us new life. Together we practise “920” (everyone in relationship with us is our “2”; we live out selflessness, the “0”; and bear the nine-fold fruit of the Spirit) and grow “235” (spiritual companions, spiritual parents and children, and a five-fold team of co-workers).": "Tunaliona tatizo letu — maisha ya zamani yanayojitazama yenyewe, kiburi, na tamaa ya kuchukua nafasi ya Mungu — na tunaiona neema ya Mungu: kifo cha Yesu kinashughulikia dhambi zetu, na ufufuo wake unatupa uzima mpya. Pamoja tunafanya mazoezi ya “920” (kila mtu tunayehusiana naye ni “2” wetu; tunaishi maisha ya kujikana nafsi, yaani “0”; na kuzaa matunda tisa ya Roho) na kukuza “235” (wenzi wa kiroho, wazazi na watoto wa kiroho, na timu ya wafanyakazi wenzi wa ngazi tano).",
 "We are building God’s system, moving into the final great revival and awaiting the Lord Jesus’ return, walking with everyone to become victors who will sit with Christ on His throne and reign forever.": "Tunajenga mpangilio wa kimungu wa Mungu, tukiingia katika uamsho mkuu wa mwisho na kungoja kurudi kwa Bwana Yesu, tukitembea pamoja na kila mtu ili tuwe washindi watakaoketi pamoja na Kristo katika kiti chake cha enzi na kutawala milele.",
